+## Host compatibility
+
+The client supports Python 3.11+ on Linux, macOS, and Windows. It uses only the Python standard
+library. The CI matrix is configured to exercise all three GitHub-hosted operating systems.
+
+Use `python3` on Linux/macOS. On Windows PowerShell, use `py -3.11` in the commands below.
+
 ## Configure the client
 
+Linux/macOS:
+
 ```bash
 export ARENA_API_URL="https://YOUR-ARENA-HOST"
 export ARENA_API_TOKEN="<YOUR_TOKEN>"
 ```
 
+Windows PowerShell:
+
+```powershell
+$env:ARENA_API_URL = "https://YOUR-ARENA-HOST"
+$env:ARENA_API_TOKEN = "<YOUR_TOKEN>"
+```
+
 ## Validate a workload without sending it
 
+The examples use `python3`; replace it with `py -3.11` on Windows PowerShell.
+
 AI workflow:
 
